    {
      "fileName": "cloud-jump.json",
      "id": "TVFfTP9fHRidwBlW",
      "name": "Cloud Jump",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "TVFfTP9fHRidwBlW",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Cloud Jump",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your unparalleled athletic skill allows you to jump impossible distances. Triple the distance you jump on a successful @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump] (so you could jump 90 feet with an Athletics result of 30). When you successfully @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High Jump], use the distance jumped and distance limit for a Long Jump but don't triple the distance.</p>\n<p>You can jump a distance greater than your Speed by spending additional actions when you Long Jump or High Jump. For each additional action spent, add your Speed to the distance limit.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Athletics"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "general",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 15,
      "category": "skill"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "craft-anything.json",
      "id": "v62QzTwHOT3t86cL",
      "name": "Craft Anything",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "v62QzTwHOT3t86cL",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Craft Anything",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can find ways to craft just about anything, despite restrictions. As long as you have the appropriate Crafting skill feat (such as Magical Crafting for magic items) and meet the item's level and proficiency requirements, you ignore just about any other requirement, such as being of a specific ancestry or providing spells. If a requirement adds to the item's cost, you must still pay it (including castings of spells that themselves have a cost). You can't ignore requirements of special items that have exclusive means of access and Crafting, such as artifacts. The GM decides whether you can ignore a requirement.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Crafting"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "general",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 15,
      "category": "skill"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "divine-guidance.json",
      "id": "dYMxP8SsHrwOze8v",
      "name": "Divine Guidance",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "dYMxP8SsHrwOze8v",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Divine Guidance",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're so immersed in divine scripture that you find meaning and guidance for any situation in your texts. Spend 10 minutes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Decipher Writing]{Deciphering Writing} on religious scriptures of your deity or philosophy while thinking about a particular problem or conundrum you face, and then attempt a @Check[religion] check (DC determined by the GM). If you succeed, you unearth a relevant passage, parable, or aphorism that can help you move forward or change your thinking to help solve your conundrum.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Religion"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "general",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 15,
      "category": "skill"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "legendary-codebreaker.json",
      "id": "Zf4yiLDdxHPovEQI",
      "name": "Legendary Codebreaker",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "Zf4yiLDdxHPovEQI",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Legendary Codebreaker",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your skill with languages and codes is so great that you can decipher information with little more than a quick read through a text. You can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Decipher Writing] using Society while reading at normal speed. If you slow down and spend the full amount of time that's ordinarily required and roll a success, you get a critical success; if you critically succeed while spending the normal amount of time, you gain a nearly word-for-word understanding of the document.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Society"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
