    {
      "fileName": "legendary-medic.json",
      "id": "Kk4AMZtpQnLEgN0b",
      "name": "Legendary Medic",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "Kk4AMZtpQnLEgN0b",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Legendary Medic",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've discovered medical breakthroughs or techniques that achieve miraculous results. Once per day for each target, you can spend 1 hour treating that target and attempt a Medicine check to remove a disease or the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained] condition. Use the DC of the disease or of the spell or effect that created the condition. If the effect's source is an artifact, above 20th level, or similarly powerful, increase the DC by 10.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Medicine"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "general",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 15,
      "category": "skill"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "legendary-negotiation.json",
      "id": "A0TNeMNvyY8QpmLz",
      "name": "Legendary Negotiation",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "A0TNeMNvyY8QpmLz",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Legendary Negotiation",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 3
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can negotiate incredibly quickly in adverse situations. You attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Make an Impression] and then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Request] your opponent cease their current activity and engage in negotiations. You take a –5 penalty to your Diplomacy check. Generally, the DC of this check is the creature's Will DC, although your GM may modify it based on the situation. Some creatures may be unable to stop regardless of their personal desires, and even those who agree to parley might ultimately find your arguments lacking and return to violence.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Diplomacy"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "general",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 15,
      "category": "skill"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "legendary-performer.json",
      "id": "467qQoiy6bjWU1G8",
      "name": "Legendary Performer",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "467qQoiy6bjWU1G8",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Legendary Performer",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your fame has spread throughout the lands. Creatures who have any listed skill in Society have heard of you and usually have an attitude toward you one step better than normal, depending on your reputation and the creature's disposition. For instance, if you're well-known for cruel and demanding behavior, creatures might be intimidated by you, rather than be friendly toward you. When you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Earn Income] with Performance, you attract higher-level audiences than your location would allow, as audiences flock to see you. For instance, rulers and angels might travel to your small tower in the woods to hear you perform. Typically, this increases the audiences available to your level or by two levels, whichever is higher.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Performance"
              },
              {
                "value": "Virtuosic Performer"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "general",
              "skill"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 15,
      "category": "skill"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "legendary-professional.json",
      "id": "GZba7ped7ZxYHchf",
      "name": "Legendary Professional",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "GZba7ped7ZxYHchf",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
