    {
      "fileName": "legendary-sneak.json",
      "id": "n0urrOL8YlnVBVRQ",
      "name": "Legendary Sneak",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "n0urrOL8YlnVBVRQ",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Legendary Sneak",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're always sneaking unless you choose to be seen, even when there's nowhere to hide. You can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] even without cover or being @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed]. When you employ an exploration tactic other than @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Avoid Notice]{Avoiding Notice}, you also gain the benefits of Avoiding Notice unless you choose not to.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 15
          },
          "prerequisites": {
