    {
      "fileName": "legendary-tattoo-artist.json",
      "id": "VRCBTEyrcBf7auGz",
      "name": "Legendary Tattoo Artist",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "VRCBTEyrcBf7auGz",
        "folder": "zQiQoKjSx6nd1teW",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Legendary Tattoo Artist",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your craftsmanship at decorating flesh is unparalleled. You become legendary in Crafting. Whenever you craft a magical tattoo whose level is at least 3 lower than your level, increase all attack roll and DC values of the tattoo's activated abilities by 1, and increase all resistances granted by the tattoo by 1.</p>"
